  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  The nuclear modification factor, $R_{\\rm AA}$, of the prompt charmed mesons ${\\rm D^0}$, ${\\rm D^+}$ and ${\\rm D^{*+}}$, and their antiparticles, was measured with the ALICE detector in Pb-Pb collisions at a centre-of-mass energy $\\sqrt{s_{\\rm NN}} = 2.76$ TeV in two transverse momentum intervals, $5<p_{\\rm T}<8$ GeV/$c$ and $8<p_{\\rm T}<16$ GeV/$c$, and in six collision centrality classes.\n",
